
### Get all wallets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets

### Get transaction history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/1/transactions

### Get newest transactions first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/2/transactions?sort=createdAt,desc

### Get only 2 transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/1/transactions?page=0&size=2

### Test a nonexistent wallet
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/99999/transactions
### Transfer money
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/1/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toWalletId": 2,
  "amount": 1.00
}